{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink Mini feels like a natural next choice because I already use Blink and could expand my indoor coverage within a familiar camera setup.",
    "The Echo Show displays interest me because a screen and video calling add a useful function alongside my Fire TV devices; I would explore the larger Show 8 first."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The HD Fire TV Stick duplicates what my existing 4K stick and Fire TV television already do, without giving me a clear reason to add it.",
    "The Echo Dot, tablet, and smart plug address needs I have not expressed, while the memory cards and reader require a specific storage need and confirmed compatibility before they become useful."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning Fire TV devices seems to have been taken as interest in almost any Amazon device, but shared branding alone does not give me a reason to buy.",
    "My camera purchases seem to suggest an automatic need for recording accessories, even though I have not identified a storage shortage or transfer problem."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: an additional device needs to extend coverage or add a useful function rather than repeat an existing capability.",
    "Familiarity and the size of the purchase matter: I would investigate Blink before switching to WYZE, but a three-camera bundle may exceed my immediate needs."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in home cameras and television devices, but stretched that interest into purchases without a clear new purpose."
}"}
